{% comment %}
  Wraps every "SUF-CPT" in the nowrap span, so the hyphenated mark never breaks
  across two lines.

  This is done in Liquid rather than in the copy because richtext and
  inline_richtext settings permit NO attributes -- `<span class="...">` is
  rejected by template validation, so a merchant cannot type it even if they
  wanted to.

  Usage, on already-escaped or already-HTML text:
    {% render 'suf-nb', text: section.settings.heading %}

  Takes the text as a string and returns it with the spans inserted. Safe to
  run on text with no occurrences.
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign nb = '<span class="suf-nb">SUF-CPT</span>' -%}
{{- text | replace: 'SUF-CPT', nb -}}
